229791=\"\" class=\"response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c2577229791-22 no-background\" jslog=\"173900;track:impression,attention\" data-hveid=\"1\" style=\"border-radius: 16px; display: flex; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-box-direction: normal; flex-direction: column; position: relative; min-height: 100%; background-color: inherit; padding-inline: 0px;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2577229791=\"\" class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c2577229791-22\" jslog=\"283401;track:impression,attention\" data-hveid=\"2\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; -webkit-box-orient: horizontal; -webkit-box-direction: normal; flex-direction: row; min-height: 100%;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2577229791=\"\" class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c2577229791-22\" style=\"padding-top: 4px; -webkit-box-flex: 1; flex: 1 1 0%; height: auto; min-width: 0px; min-height: 100%;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3260956542=\"\" class=\"response-content ng-tns-c2577229791-22\" style=\"\"><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c3260956542=\"\" class=\"model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c3439570460=\"\" style=\"display: block; overflow-x: visible; width: 724px; height: auto;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">在網路上經常見到的一個指控就是“雙標”。確實，在大部分情況下，雙標不可取，但若事關於敵我矛盾，情況就會有些許不一樣，甚至可以直接說，敵我矛盾就是可以雙標的。</span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">一方面，敵我矛盾的情況中可以合理的進行“一定程度”的雙標，當然這個「度」要控制好，以免完全失去其正義性和正當性，此時的雙標作為一種鞏固己方的手段，需要非常小心使用。例如在敵我衝突或者戰爭狀態下，「一視同仁」的策略確實顯得不切實際，他的合理性來自於緊急情況下的「例外狀態」，是己方生存與核心價值的維繫。</span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">另一方面，就是權利關係等客觀條件的不同，例如階級之類的社會地位的差距；是性別或其他先天或後天的生理上的差距等等。當然，這種情況在現代法學和社會學中通常也不被視為雙標。而是會被稱作「合理的區別對待」、「糾偏措施」等。</span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">這裡需要說明一個重要的觀念：「形式平等」和「實質平等」的差距。形式平等，即對所有人套完全相同的規則；實質平等則是可用客觀條件的不平等，給予相適應的補償。這種合理的雙標的邏輯基礎是雙方在資源、權力或生理條件上存在客觀差距時，若硬要套用相同的標準，反而會造成強者對弱者的合法壓迫。例如勞基法偏向保護勞工，因為資本方擁有經濟和制度上的優勢地位、刑法對未成年人減刑、稅務上的累進稅率等等。而這一類補償性的機制一樣非常難以拿捏，若補償過度，或者將弱者當作所有責任的豁免權，就會反向變成另一種形式上的不公平。</span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">很多時候則是內部矛盾沒處理或者沒處理好，演變成了敵我矛盾</span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><font color=\"#e3e3e3\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">簡單解釋，敵我矛盾就是敵人攻擊我說明我做對了；內部矛盾就是朋友反對我；內部矛盾處理不好就是朋友反對我，說明朋友是敵人。&nbsp;</span></font></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" class=\"container\" style=\"color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; padding: 0px 8px 8px;\"><br></div><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3439570460=\"\" _nghost-ng-c3080088156=\"\" id=\"message-content-id-r_7181e1328ff4e7ce\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3080088156=\"\" inline-copy-host=\"\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7181e1328ff4e7ce\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"off\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--gds-type-scale-default-rond: &quot;ROND&quot; 0; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Flex&quot;, &quot;Google Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 26px; --gds-type-scale-default-wdth: &quot;wdth&quot; 92; --gds-type-scale-default-wght: &quot;wght&quot; 400; font-variation-settings: &quot;ROND&quot; 0, &quot;slnt&quot; 0, &quot;wdth&quot; 92, &quot;wght&quot; 400; --gds-type-scale-bold-wght: &quot;wght&quot; 540; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline-end: 0px; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-box-direction: normal; flex-direction: column; gap: 0px; --animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;\"></div></message-content></div></structured-content-container></div></div></div></div></response-container></div></model-response>","paperHeight":1130,"canvasData":{"paths":[]},"updatedAt":1786533214027,"isCompleted":false}